WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:02.127
Pay… or know when not to.

00:02.620 --> 00:05.117
Tap the orb. It reads your screen.

00:05.920 --> 00:09.825
Say who to pay. ENS works too. You choose the network.

00:10.520 --> 00:13.678
Something feels off? Scam Shield shows you why.

00:16.420 --> 00:21.157
Let Claude or Codex ask to pay. You set the limits. You approve.

00:23.420 --> 00:26.151
Check the fee, then confirm on your phone.

00:27.620 --> 00:31.375
Receive by QR. See your history. Cap your spending.

00:32.920 --> 00:37.240
Read it aloud. Basic parsing works when the agent's offline.

00:37.400 --> 00:39.299
Orb. Pay where you are.
